{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "eno1_minmod_D1y",
    "description": "Pointwise first-order ENO derivative d u/dy at the cell (i, j) of cartesian_uniform_2d: stencils/eno1_minmod of the backward difference dl = (u[i,j] - u[i,j-1])/dy and the forward difference dr = (u[i,j+1] - u[i,j])/dy. fire_behavior's Select_eno (diffLx, diffRx) (respectively diffLy, diffRy). u is the field, i and j the cell indices, bound by the caller's faq (a pass-through of its loop symbols, as in stencils/eno1_wall_band); dy is the grid's free-name spacing. It reaches one cell either side along y, so a caller evaluates it only where both neighbours exist -- the wall lines use a ghost instead (rules/weno5_eno1_D1y_extrapolate_frame). The one spelling of the ENO1 branch shared by the weno5_eno1_*D1y_interior stencils and the ENO1 strips of the D1y frame.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:D",
      "axes:y",
      "order:1",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Harten, A., Engquist, B., Osher, S., & Chakravarthy, S. R. (1987). Uniformly high order accurate essentially non-oscillatory schemes, III. Journal of Computational Physics, 71(2), 231-303. ENO stencil selection by smallest divided difference (first-order form: the minmod limiter).",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(87)90031-3"
      },
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Calc_tend_ls, Select_eno, Select_weno5, Select_4th, Select_godunov (case 4), Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "eno1_minmod.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "eno1_minmod_D1y": {
      "params": [
        "u",
        "i",
        "j"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "eno1_minmod",
        "bindings": {
          "dl": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "index",
                    "args": [
                      "u",
                      "i",
                      "j"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "index",
                    "args": [
                      "u",
                      "i",
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          "j",
                          1
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "dy"
            ]
          },
          "dr": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "index",
                    "args": [
                      "u",
                      "i",
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          "j",
                          1
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "index",
                    "args": [
                      "u",
                      "i",
                      "j"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "dy"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
